<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. Five stars filled to a rating (0 to 5, halves and any other
  fraction: 4.5 fills four stars and half of the fifth). No rating (0) prints
  the row hidden, so a section never shows stars the customer did not give;
  it stays in the page so a rating typed in the builder shows at once
  (assets/live-r7-testimonials.js writes the same fills).
  rating: the number. label: the words read out before the score (optional).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign r7_rating = rating | default: 0 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 5 -%}
<span class="r7t-stars" role="img" aria-label="{{ r7_rating }} / 5" data-r7t-stars{% if r7_rating <= 0 %} hidden{% endif %}>
  {%- for n in (1..5) -%}
    {%- assign r7_fill = r7_rating | minus: n | plus: 1 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 1 | times: 100 | round -%}
    <span class="r7t-star" style="--r7t-fill: {{ r7_fill }}%;" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2l2.95 6.27L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l7.05-1z"/></svg></span>
  {%- endfor -%}
</span>
</template>
